    "description": "Blob.CreateInStream and Blob.CreateOutStream take an optional TextEncoding; when it is omitted, the stream uses MSDos (OEM) encoding, whose code page depends on the server's system locale. Encoding matters when an operation converts between AL text and bytes, such as WriteText or ReadText.",
